# vcontext runtime env overrides — sourced by vcontext-wrapper.sh BEFORE
# the NODE_OPTIONS export (order fixed 2026-04-23 as part of P0b-heap).
#
# P0b-heap (2026-04-23): reduce JS heap cap 4096 MB → 2048 MB
#   Rationale: heap peak observed today 820 MB (warm-up), yesterday 735 MB.
#              2048 cap = 2.5x headroom, frees 2 GB RSS budget to system.
#   Audit:     docs/analysis/2026-04-23-p0b-rss-reduction-audit.md
#
# This is the documented configuration surface. wrapper.sh resolves
# `--max-old-space-size=${VCONTEXT_MAX_HEAP_MB:-4096}` so a value here
# wins over the 4096 default. Delete this file (or unset the var) to
# revert to the 4096 default.
VCONTEXT_MAX_HEAP_MB=2048
